--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Sources consulted for the sample scripts
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

No code is copied from any of the following. They are the public references the
sample scripts were written against, and they are cited so that readers can
check the commands and API calls used here against their documented behaviour.

IBM z/OSMF REST services
  Endpoint paths, request headers, and response fields follow IBM's published
  z/OSMF programming documentation.

IBM Z Open Automation Utilities
  https://github.com/IBM/zoau-samples (Apache-2.0)
  The operator commands used in the samples are display-only commands drawn from
  IBM's published ZOAU one-liners.

Galasa
  https://galasa.dev and https://github.com/galasa-dev/simplatform (EPL-2.0)
  The TN3270 samples target SimBank, Galasa's sample 3270 application. Nothing
  from Galasa is vendored here; the scripts connect to SimBank over the network
  and read the screens it sends.

Zowe
  https://github.com/zowe/zowe-cli (EPL-2.0)
  Used as a cross-check on z/OSMF REST resource paths.

IBM CICS
  Transaction identifiers used in the samples (CESN, CESF) and the message
  identifiers matched against are from IBM's published CICS documentation.
